abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for an asymptotic fresh-single-pass hard-dose
  lower bound and a computer-assisted finite-size certificate at N=4096,
  under its documented number-sector restriction, for fourfold forrelation.
keywords:
  - fourfold forrelation
  - quantum query complexity
  - computational sensing
